## 💡 Part 4: The Simplest Form of the Solution (MVP)

### Core Idea
> Build an **AI Voice Assistant** that a beneficiary can **call on a simple phone** (no smartphone needed), speak in their **local language**, and the AI will:
> 1. Collect their livelihood data (what they do, what skills they have)
> 2. Map their skills to the right NSQF level
> 3. Recommend the best skilling program for them
> 4. Track their progress over time

