### MVP Components Breakdown

| Component | Technology | Purpose |
|-----------|-----------|---------|
| **Phone Interface** | IVR (Interactive Voice Response) / Telephony API (Twilio/Exotel) | Let users call a toll-free number |
| **Speech-to-Text** | Google Speech API / Whisper / Bhashini | Convert voice → text in Indian languages |
| **NLP/AI Engine** | LLM (GPT/Gemini) + Custom fine-tuning | Understand intent, extract skill data, have conversational flow |
| **NSQF Mapper** | Rule-based engine + ML | Map extracted skills → NSQF levels → available programs |
| **Database** | PostgreSQL / MongoDB | Store beneficiary profiles, skills, training status |
| **Text-to-Speech** | Google TTS / Bhashini | Convert response text → voice in local language |
| **Admin Dashboard** | Web App (React/Next.js) | For officials to view data, analytics, approve registrations |

